## Project Setup

### Prerequisites

- [.NET 8.0 SDK](https://dotnet.microsoft.com/download/dotnet/8.0) or later
- [Visual Studio 2022](https://visualstudio.microsoft.com/) (optional, for IDE support)
- [Visual Studio Code](https://code.visualstudio.com/) (optional, with C# extension)
- [SQL Server 2022](https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/sql-server/sql-server-2022) or [Azure Data Studio](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/sql/azure-data-studio/what-is-azure-data-studio) (optional, for database)

### Create a New Project

```bash
# Create a new ASP.NET Core Web API project
dotnet new webapi -n <%= projectName || 'AspNetCoreApp' %> -f net8.0

# Navigate to the project directory
cd <%= projectName || 'AspNetCoreApp' %>

# Add required packages
dotnet add package Microsoft.AspNetCore.Authentication.JwtBearer
dotnet add package Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore
dotnet add package Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.SqlServer
dotnet add package Swashbuckle.AspNetCore
```

